    {
      "sentence_id": "s1",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "在我面前的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s2",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "就是刚刚发布的新iPad Pro"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s3",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "大家好 我是何同学"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s4",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "今天就在现场给大家看一看"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s5",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "苹果5月7号发布的新品"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s6",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "这就是新的iPad Pro"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s7",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "外观上看它最大的变化就是薄了很多"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s8",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "只有5.3毫米"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s9",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "但整体上看外观的变化其实并不大"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s10",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "内在的话"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s11",
      "char_len": 23,
      "snippet": "这代所有的iPad Pro都换上了OLED屏幕"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s12",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "这个屏幕有个很霸气的名字"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s13",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "叫Ultra Retina XDR"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s14",
      "char_len": 8,
      "snippet": "我肉眼看这个屏幕"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s15",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "怎么说呢"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s16",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "其实感受没有很明显"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s17",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "也许更亮一点吧"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s18",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "我们有评测样机后会进行更细致的测试"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s19",
      "char_len": 24,
      "snippet": "而且这一代iPad还可以选配抗反光的纳米纹理玻璃"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s20",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "我们还是不知道能不能在写字的时候"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s21",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "提供一种类似于类纸膜的感觉"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s22",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "然后就是iPad Pro的芯片"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s23",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "从M2直接升级到了M4"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s24",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "要知道现在Mac上面都没有M4"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s25",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "所以很期待它的性能表现"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s26",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "虽然说M2的性能我也用不太上"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s27",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "这次的配件也有很大的升级"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s28",
      "char_len": 38,
      "snippet": "Apple Pencil在六年后终于升级成了Apple Pencil Pro"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s29",
      "char_len": 27,
      "snippet": "不禁让我们怀疑是不是以后苹果的手机壳也会出一个Pro版"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s30",
      "char_len": 25,
      "snippet": "这次的Apple Pencil Pro升级点有3个"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s31",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "一个就是它多了一个维度的操控"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s32",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "大家可以看到这个笔在旋转的时候"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s33",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "画笔底下的角度也会跟着一起旋转"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s34",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "然后它还支持了一个挤压的操作"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s35",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "它挤一下就可以出这个快捷键"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s36",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "然后妙控键盘这边也更新了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s37",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "它的这个材质变成了铝合金"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s38",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "不得不说摸起来还是非常舒服"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s39",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "而且更加高端了一些"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s40",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "然后整体也更加轻了一些"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s41",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "然后这个触控板明显是大了很多很多"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s42",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "这里还多了一排功能键"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s43",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "所以确实是一个很好的升级"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s44",
      "char_len": 20,
      "snippet": "iPad Air这边的升级就没有这么大了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s45",
      "char_len": 22,
      "snippet": "好消息是我们现在有了13寸的iPad Air"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s46",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "它的处理器也从M1升级到了M2"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s47",
      "char_len": 18,
      "snippet": "但是坏消息是它应该还是60Hz的屏幕"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s48",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "没有错 还是60Hz的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s49",
      "char_len": 8,
      "snippet": "最后再说一说颜色"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s50",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "iPad Air这边的颜色有"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s51",
      "char_len": 2,
      "snippet": "灰色"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s52",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "星光色"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s53",
      "char_len": 2,
      "snippet": "紫色"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s54",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "和绿色"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s55",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "这是我在现场可以拍到的全部信息了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s56",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "感谢你可以看到这里"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s57",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "在拿到样机后"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s58",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "我们还会出一期首发体验视频"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s59",
